MoveRate3()
{
//landing?
	spin ring1 around x-axis speed <60> accelerate <200>;
	spin ring2 around x-axis speed <40> accelerate <200>;
	spin ring2 around y-axis speed <20> accelerate <200>;
	spin ring3 around z-axis speed <20> accelerate <200>;
